WEBVTT

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:21.620
Both today and tomorrow, I've got time to kick back.

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:21.620
kyou mo ashita mo HIMAKKUSU

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:24.830
My family of four and I are going to stay the night.

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:24.830
gokazoku yonin de goippaku

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.670
Put on an Egyptian front and become a sphinx,

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.670
EGIPUTO kidori de SUFINKUSU

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:30.460
and for an American feeling, Texas!

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:30.460
AMERICA kibun de TEXAS

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:33.470
When you're sitting pretty, with enough and to spare,

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:33.470
yoyuu SHAKUSHAKUPPE itsumo

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.680
and yet you always shilly-shally,

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.680
funya funya de iruto

00:00:36.640 --> 00:00:39.930
and your bitter face and bitter feelings both teeter-totter,

00:00:36.640 --> 00:00:39.930
nigamushi hara no mushi nahe nahe to

00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:43.390
it's time to get out of there!

00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:43.390
tettai shichau yo

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:46.690
I am feeling Ultra Relax,

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:46.690
watashi ha URUTORA RIRAKKUSU

00:00:47.230 --> 00:00:49.900
a wonderful, invincible Relax.

00:00:47.230 --> 00:00:49.900
SUTEKI ni muteki na RIRAKKUSU

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:52.860
A one-step-above kind of Deluxe.

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:52.860
hito aji chigau ze DERAKKUSU

00:00:53.190 --> 00:00:54.070
I may be a little jumbled,

00:00:53.190 --> 00:00:54.070
toccharakatte mo

00:00:54.150 --> 00:00:55.820
but when I'm called on, ba-ba-ba-ba-bang!

00:00:54.150 --> 00:00:55.820
yobarerya PAPAPAPAAAN!

00:00:56.200 --> 00:00:58.910
I always feel Relax,

00:00:56.200 --> 00:00:58.910
watashi ha itsudemo RIRAKKUSU

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.910
a humble, simple, sort of Deluxe.

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.910
WABISABI kikasete DERAKKUSU

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:04.830
Bright! Clear! Alert-headed, peep-peep!

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:04.830
BIKKARI! KIKKARI! saeteru ATAMA PII! PII!

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:07.960
Keep your eyes on me, okay?!

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:07.960
watashi no KOTO dake mitete ne!

00:01:33.740 --> 00:01:39.450
Sengoku-sensei, please help me,
I don't know what I am anymore.

00:01:39.820 --> 00:01:43.580
Will someone be worried
about me if I'm gone?

00:01:44.250 --> 00:01:47.420
I was asked to join the karate
club by Hayama-kun.

00:01:47.420 --> 00:01:50.460
I was so happy that he talked to me.

00:01:50.460 --> 00:01:54.510
I didn't think about the consequences on joining the karate club.

00:01:55.550 --> 00:02:02.310
But I never thought that training
would be so hard. I have tried my best.

00:02:02.640 --> 00:02:06.060
It was too much hard for me and I had to stay home from school.

00:02:07.560 --> 00:02:13.400
I've never been absent from school
and that was my only pride.

00:02:13.400 --> 00:02:16.400
I broke that record by myself,

00:02:16.900 --> 00:02:22.990
but Hayamakun said that Karate is
too much for me and I was so sad.

00:02:23.370 --> 00:02:27.290
My precious no absence record has been destroyed

00:02:27.410 --> 00:02:33.630
and I was forced to quit Karate
Club. I have nothing left for myself.

00:02:37.220 --> 00:02:38.630
He...

00:02:41.090 --> 00:02:45.010
Didn't want to quit.

00:02:49.810 --> 00:02:54.020
I didn't understand him either.

00:02:54.650 --> 00:02:56.190
He...

00:02:59.610 --> 00:03:06.080
It seems I care more about myself
than him.

00:03:06.870 --> 00:03:11.750
I must be sad because I have
sanction today.

00:03:15.210 --> 00:03:18.920
I'm thinking about that in this
situation.

00:03:20.970 --> 00:03:23.930
Hayama, that thing...

00:03:27.390 --> 00:03:31.100
It's... not only you. I also...

00:03:32.770 --> 00:03:34.650
I'm thinking about my work too...

00:03:35.270 --> 00:03:39.400
But I'm sure that your feelings could be only
understood by yourself

00:03:39.400 --> 00:03:42.450
and Nakao-kun's feelings could only
be understood by himself.

00:03:42.450 --> 00:03:43.950
But I... that is...

00:04:00.170 --> 00:04:06.600
Three Disappeared
Together

00:04:03.340 --> 00:04:06.470
Nakao-kun's letter had a
continuation actually...

00:04:09.350 --> 00:04:10.810
What the hell?!

00:04:10.930 --> 00:04:14.980
I couldn't see!
What does it say?!

00:04:15.100 --> 00:04:17.440
What is Sengoku doing? Let's see.

00:04:18.730 --> 00:04:20.230
Are you there, Sengoku?!

00:04:22.280 --> 00:04:23.530
Oh, you're here.

00:04:23.530 --> 00:04:25.200
Everyone please listen.

00:04:26.240 --> 00:04:29.200
We have found out that Year 1,
Class 1,

00:04:29.200 --> 00:04:31.910
Nakao Shouta did not come home
since yesterday.

00:04:31.910 --> 00:04:34.290
- Student's parents...
- You hid it, didn't you?! Let's see it!

00:04:34.620 --> 00:04:36.960
If I wasn't a Babbit then I would
have pulled it out.

00:04:36.960 --> 00:04:40.710
But if I'm not a Babbit then I
can't let everyone see what it says.

00:04:40.630 --> 00:04:43.380
Nakao-kun's letter

00:04:41.800 --> 00:04:43.420
It's hard...

00:04:44.300 --> 00:04:47.350
That day we couldn't settle down.

00:04:47.600 --> 00:04:52.140
The school let out the news of
Nakao-kun's disappearance

00:04:52.140 --> 00:04:54.810
to look for clues on his
whereabouts,

00:04:54.810 --> 00:04:59.770
but most of people
don't knew Nakao-kun.

00:05:00.110 --> 00:05:04.200
The police couldn't figure it out.

00:05:05.110 --> 00:05:10.120
Sengoku-sensei's announcement
seemed to be different from other teachers.

00:05:10.120 --> 00:05:14.080
It sounded like it was definite
that it was all Akito-kun's fault.

00:05:14.330 --> 00:05:19.290
For this incident the people who
made the karate club are deeply involved.

00:05:20.040 --> 00:05:24.300
If someone is involved in the
karate club then reach up.

00:05:24.720 --> 00:05:31.140
Although it will hurt your heart,
the case is very bad.

00:05:31.310 --> 00:05:34.480
The rumor spread quickly

00:05:34.480 --> 00:05:38.520
and all kids looked at Sana and
Aki as if they were criminals.

00:05:39.560 --> 00:05:43.400
I heard that kid Nakao ran away
because of Hayama's torturous training.

00:05:43.400 --> 00:05:45.530
Don't let Hayama hear this word.

00:05:45.900 --> 00:05:53.410
The people who stood up for us was
Jinbo Elementary School's 6th grade class 3.

00:05:53.540 --> 00:05:55.910
Except from them,

00:05:55.910 --> 00:06:00.630
we have really been treated insensibly.

00:06:00.630 --> 00:06:04.920
Although I wasn't Jinbo Elementary
School, 6th grade class 3, I'm Sana's friend.

00:06:04.920 --> 00:06:07.840
But the reality here is too cruel.

00:06:09.590 --> 00:06:15.390
Ah... my mother is diagnosed with an
incurable disease, so I have to nurse...

00:06:15.390 --> 00:06:18.980
Even I'm pity... I have to quit the karate club. Sorry, bye!

00:06:19.150 --> 00:06:20.560
This is true.

00:06:24.480 --> 00:06:26.740
Ahh, he's a real idiot, isn't he?

00:06:26.740 --> 00:06:32.070
They have much reason. Because of my
heart, I must quit the karate club.

00:06:32.070 --> 00:06:32.910
What's that?

00:06:32.910 --> 00:06:34.540
You can know more
easily if we discussed about body.

00:06:34.540 --> 00:06:37.710
Yeah, he was more concerned about
his conduct grade.

00:06:37.710 --> 00:06:38.540
That's right.

00:06:38.540 --> 00:06:39.710
They're conversing.

00:06:40.210 --> 00:06:41.710
Where are you going, Hayama?

00:06:43.840 --> 00:06:45.130
Akito-kun.

00:06:45.800 --> 00:06:47.800
- Sana-chan? What happened?
- Wait.

00:06:48.050 --> 00:06:50.340
Right now, only Sana should go.

00:06:55.560 --> 00:06:56.970
See?

00:07:03.440 --> 00:07:08.900
Hayama. I wonder if I didn't think
about the consequences and acted again.

00:07:09.320 --> 00:07:12.910
Making a karate club,
only because I'm stirring.

00:07:12.910 --> 00:07:16.540
I... this is what I am.

00:07:17.500 --> 00:07:20.540
If you get involved with me then
nothing good will happen to you.

00:07:22.210 --> 00:07:24.960
It's almost time to get my new
karate belt.

00:07:25.460 --> 00:07:28.840
Hey listen up. I heard about you
wanting to get your belt.

00:07:28.840 --> 00:07:31.010
You're thinking about that...

00:07:31.010 --> 00:07:35.890
So you're feeling irresponsible for not thinking about him, right?

00:07:36.100 --> 00:07:38.310
Think! Just think!

00:07:38.310 --> 00:07:40.770
If humans are living than they can
think a lot of things!

00:07:45.610 --> 00:07:49.780
Everybody has to think for
themselves, that's what they are...

00:07:49.780 --> 00:07:51.360
That's such a general way of
thinking.

00:07:51.360 --> 00:07:52.780
This voice that pisses me off.

00:07:53.240 --> 00:07:56.490
In this state of situation, you
guys are just licking each other's wounds.

00:07:56.910 --> 00:07:59.000
I'm sure Nakao is fine

00:07:59.580 --> 00:08:03.170
but this time you can't get away with it.

00:08:04.790 --> 00:08:08.880
Before this happened, I wanted to
expel you though.

00:08:09.050 --> 00:08:11.340
Sensei, you look like you're having fun.

00:08:11.470 --> 00:08:12.300
What?

00:08:12.510 --> 00:08:16.930
It's like the wig that found the
perfect prey and is licking its chops.

00:08:16.930 --> 00:08:18.390
It's the bald eagle.

00:08:20.430 --> 00:08:24.980
Your idol girlfriend doesn't know
how to talk to adults.

00:08:24.980 --> 00:08:26.150
What the hell...

00:08:26.150 --> 00:08:30.320
But I will never approve of a
student like you.

00:08:30.320 --> 00:08:34.360
You made Nakao think he had no reason to keep on living.

00:08:34.360 --> 00:08:38.370
But I'm saying
that you have no meaning in life.

00:08:39.370 --> 00:08:40.540
You've gone to far.

00:08:41.500 --> 00:08:45.210
Was that written in there in that
letter?

00:08:52.800 --> 00:08:56.840
But anyway, when something does
happen to Nakao, then prepare yourself.

00:09:02.220 --> 00:09:03.810
What the hell was that...

00:09:06.190 --> 00:09:10.400
Let's think about the missing
chalkboard erasers.

00:09:10.690 --> 00:09:13.280
In balcony of the north old school
building, there's a room,

00:09:13.280 --> 00:09:16.450
I'm in charge of the chalkboard
erasers so I know.

00:09:16.740 --> 00:09:17.950
Kurata!

00:09:18.660 --> 00:09:20.620
- Hey wait!
- Nakao is in the Karate room!

00:09:20.700 --> 00:09:22.830
- The Karate Club's?
- He's there!

00:09:23.330 --> 00:09:24.540
Got it!

00:09:24.540 --> 00:09:27.080
Move, move it!
It's the nnorth old school building!

00:09:30.290 --> 00:09:31.670
I'll get the keys!

00:09:31.670 --> 00:09:33.090
It's no use,
it's stuck!

00:09:34.130 --> 00:09:36.630
- Nakao, answer!
- Nakao-kun, are you there?

00:09:36.840 --> 00:09:38.510
- Nakao-kun!
- Nakao!

00:09:49.440 --> 00:09:53.110
Nakao-kun, open up! Answer, answer!

00:09:53.190 --> 00:09:55.780
Say energetically loud!

00:09:56.030 --> 00:09:57.910
Hayama, where are you going?

00:10:02.790 --> 00:10:04.870
Wow, you could peek inside there!

00:10:05.080 --> 00:10:09.380
Alright! With my graceful Komawari Step!

00:10:09.500 --> 00:10:12.170
Ooh yeah! Stretch!

00:10:13.130 --> 00:10:14.550
Here I am!

00:10:14.550 --> 00:10:15.970
Hayama, how did you get here?

00:10:16.010 --> 00:10:18.510
While you were doing unneeded
movements.

00:10:18.510 --> 00:10:20.220
- Is he there?
- I can't see, it's too dark.

00:10:20.220 --> 00:10:22.010
Where? Ouch!

00:10:22.010 --> 00:10:24.640
It's no use, we can't get in further.

00:10:25.430 --> 00:10:27.890
- Nakao-kun, are you there?
- Nakao!

00:10:29.150 --> 00:10:31.610
It's you Nakao-kun, right?

00:10:32.110 --> 00:10:34.150
Are you alive? Hey!

00:10:36.530 --> 00:10:37.320
Who...

00:10:37.440 --> 00:10:38.900
Nakao! It's me!

00:10:39.280 --> 00:10:40.870
Hayama-kun...

00:10:40.870 --> 00:10:43.160
And Kurata Sana,
13 years old.

00:10:43.160 --> 00:10:44.910
Are you alright?

00:10:44.910 --> 00:10:46.370
Nakao-kun?

00:10:47.620 --> 00:10:50.580
Sensei is...

00:10:50.580 --> 00:10:53.000
Sensei?
What about Sensei?

00:10:55.210 --> 00:10:56.260
Nakao!

00:10:56.260 --> 00:10:58.840
Hayama, I'll go get
Suzuki-sensei!

00:10:58.840 --> 00:11:00.010
Ok.

00:11:03.510 --> 00:11:06.850
- Hurry and go.
- Hayama, my head is stuck.

00:11:06.890 --> 00:11:08.310
Idiot.

00:11:09.600 --> 00:11:10.600
Me too.

00:11:10.690 --> 00:11:13.690
What?!

00:11:13.900 --> 00:11:15.070
Shup up.

00:11:15.070 --> 00:11:19.820
Nakao-kun was found but a stupid
looking sight.

00:11:36.000 --> 00:11:38.130
What... are you doing?

00:11:38.380 --> 00:11:40.590
I'm trying to get my head out.

00:11:41.880 --> 00:11:44.720
I wasn't talking to you,
I was talking to Nakao.

00:11:44.850 --> 00:11:47.100
Then don't look at me and say it.

00:11:47.100 --> 00:11:49.140
My neck doesn't move.

00:11:49.520 --> 00:11:54.690
You don't even try yet, you should
do something called Hard Work.

00:11:55.400 --> 00:11:58.320
Idiot, my somewhere's stuck...

00:11:58.320 --> 00:12:00.490
Ok, let me see... Ah!

00:12:00.610 --> 00:12:02.700
The nail is about to
pierce your head!

00:12:02.700 --> 00:12:03.780
When I move it hurts.

00:12:03.780 --> 00:12:07.790
I got it. First I'll save myself
then you, Hayama.

00:12:07.790 --> 00:12:11.830
It will slip out like this...

00:12:12.960 --> 00:12:14.920
Actually your
hair is gnarly.

00:12:14.920 --> 00:12:18.960
Nakao-kun!
Were you here since yesterday?

00:12:16.840 --> 00:12:18.960
You gave up already?

00:12:22.340 --> 00:12:24.090
Nakao-kun?

00:12:24.970 --> 00:12:28.850
I'm gonna become a mummy.

00:12:30.560 --> 00:12:36.110
It's best for me
to become a mummy.

00:12:36.360 --> 00:12:38.860
What are you saying?

00:12:38.860 --> 00:12:43.570
Because that's what's best for me.

00:12:44.700 --> 00:12:48.530
Hey! Don't talk stupid! If you
become a mummy you'll be dead!

00:12:48.530 --> 00:12:51.870
If you die then you'll become a mummy,
do you want it that way, huh?!

00:12:51.950 --> 00:12:54.160
- Will you be quiet for a second.
- Why?

00:12:54.160 --> 00:12:58.710
Because it's not informative and
it won't make sense. You will make trouble!

00:13:00.250 --> 00:13:01.420
What is it?

00:13:01.420 --> 00:13:04.380
I know! I will out an
SOS to Rei-kun on my cell.

00:13:07.010 --> 00:13:08.140
What now?

00:13:08.140 --> 00:13:09.510
It's in my bag.

00:13:11.220 --> 00:13:12.980
Sana didn't come back yet?

00:13:12.980 --> 00:13:13.930
No.

00:13:14.440 --> 00:13:16.440
She was with Akito.

00:13:17.310 --> 00:13:18.940
You are really...

00:13:19.190 --> 00:13:21.110
What is it...?

00:13:23.740 --> 00:13:26.570
Don't be silent,
that makes me lonely.

00:13:26.570 --> 00:13:28.950
I read your letter.

00:13:30.740 --> 00:13:39.500
I thought that you wanted to quit
the Karate club.

00:13:39.840 --> 00:13:44.050
So what do you say...

00:13:45.010 --> 00:13:46.300
I'm sorry...

00:13:46.430 --> 00:13:48.470
What? Are you saying that
from the heart?

00:13:48.470 --> 00:13:50.390
- Yeah.
- No, it's not.

00:13:50.390 --> 00:13:52.600
When you apologize
from the heart then you look at the person.

00:13:52.640 --> 00:13:54.480
I told you that
I can't turn my head!

00:13:55.230 --> 00:13:56.940
Yeah, me too...

00:13:57.770 --> 00:14:02.610
So Nakao-kun,
it's all this scumbag's fault.

00:14:02.610 --> 00:14:03.940
That pisses me off.

00:14:03.940 --> 00:14:05.780
So... So that means...

00:14:05.780 --> 00:14:10.030
I don't think that really means
for you to become a mummy.

00:14:10.030 --> 00:14:16.000
That letter...
Sengoku-sensei, let us see it.

00:14:16.250 --> 00:14:18.960
Did Sensei read it too?

00:14:18.960 --> 00:14:20.710
Hmm... Yes.

00:14:24.460 --> 00:14:26.550
Eh? Akito-kun didn't return yet?

00:14:26.550 --> 00:14:28.010
He was with Sana-chan.

00:14:28.010 --> 00:14:31.600
- Eh, we're starting class?
- Yes, we are.

00:14:32.050 --> 00:14:33.890
Sensei, what about Nakao-kun?

00:14:33.890 --> 00:14:36.480
We didn't have any progress yet.

00:14:36.480 --> 00:14:37.770
Ah, where's Hayama-kun?

00:14:38.060 --> 00:14:39.650
He's pissed off.

00:14:39.650 --> 00:14:42.690
If Sengoku-sensei said anything
like that to Hayama, that's why he would be.

00:14:46.190 --> 00:14:49.570
Nakao, let's go. Just as she said.

00:14:49.570 --> 00:14:50.530
Me?

00:14:50.530 --> 00:14:53.580
I think it's almost my fault.

00:14:53.580 --> 00:14:55.620
That'right,
so let's get out of here.

00:14:55.620 --> 00:14:58.080
I don't want to leave.

00:14:59.500 --> 00:15:04.800
Even if I go out, there's nothing
for me out there.

00:15:04.800 --> 00:15:09.220
I'm a useless human...

00:15:09.590 --> 00:15:13.510
I have no
meaning in life.

00:15:13.760 --> 00:15:16.430
What are you saying?

00:15:16.430 --> 00:15:21.350
Because I never helped out anyone.

00:15:21.940 --> 00:15:25.230
And nobody cares about me.

00:15:26.110 --> 00:15:31.990
So I thought that I should become a mummy, here.

00:15:32.320 --> 00:15:37.540
I thought he would come at first and I waited...

00:15:38.290 --> 00:15:40.410
Sengoku-sensei...

00:15:40.410 --> 00:15:44.880
But nobody came after all,

00:15:45.420 --> 00:15:51.840
and I thought nothing matters
anymore.

00:15:52.300 --> 00:15:53.590
Hey you!

00:15:53.590 --> 00:15:55.050
Kurata! Leave it!

00:15:55.050 --> 00:15:57.390
- Why?!
- Because you sound too rowdy.

00:15:59.100 --> 00:16:01.060
Don't shake it, my head hurts.

00:16:01.480 --> 00:16:06.230
Now, Nakao-kun, get yourself
together. Hey, come on now.

00:16:06.230 --> 00:16:09.360
With that kind of an attitude what will you do in life?

00:16:09.360 --> 00:16:12.400
You don't understand.

00:16:14.030 --> 00:16:18.120
You guys are always so cool.

00:16:19.040 --> 00:16:22.040
Cool?
Who's cool?

00:16:22.290 --> 00:16:25.750
Hayama-kun is so great...

00:16:26.000 --> 00:16:29.170
not anything like me.

00:16:29.340 --> 00:16:32.590
What? Hayama is great?
That's a misunderstanding.

00:16:32.590 --> 00:16:35.140
He is so uncool that there isn't
anyone like him.

00:16:35.510 --> 00:16:40.350
He only can say 'What and stuff
like that', he's not a great speaker

00:16:40.520 --> 00:16:43.600
and he's always moony somewhere.

00:16:45.060 --> 00:16:48.900
And so he always carries all the
weight and gets more enclosed.

00:16:49.900 --> 00:16:53.530
And live on his own world...

00:16:54.150 --> 00:16:57.200
and make everyone worry about him.

